#: includes/admin-tabs.php:125
msgid ""
"Choose how this site sends and which provider first: the key belongs to one "
"of them."
msgstr ""
"Elegí primero cómo envía el sitio y con qué proveedor: la clave es de uno de"
" ellos."

#: includes/admin-tabs.php:126
msgid ""
"Choose a provider profile first: it fills in the host, the port and the "
"encryption this tab asks for."
msgstr ""
"Elegí primero un perfil de proveedor: completa el servidor, el puerto y el "
"cifrado que esta solapa te pide."

#: includes/admin-tabs.php:129
msgid ""
"The provider has to accept the key first. Check it on the previous tab; "
"until it does, there is nothing to send with."
msgstr ""
"Primero el proveedor tiene que aceptar la clave. Verificala en la solapa "
"anterior; hasta que la acepte, no hay con qué enviar."

#: includes/admin-tabs.php:130
msgid ""
"The SMTP server has to answer first. Test the connection on the previous "
"tab; until it does, there is nothing to send from."
msgstr ""
"Primero tiene que contestar el servidor SMTP. Probá la conexión en la solapa"
" anterior; hasta que conteste, no hay desde dónde enviar."

#: includes/admin-tabs.php:132
msgid ""
"Set the From address first: a provider will not deliver a message sent from "
"an address it has not verified."
msgstr ""
"Cargá primero la dirección del remitente: ningún proveedor entrega un "
"mensaje enviado desde una dirección que no verificó."

#. translators: 1: step number, 2: name of the step
#: includes/admin-tabs.php:254
#, php-format
msgctxt "numbered step in the settings screen"
msgid "%1$d. %2$s"
msgstr "%1$d. %2$s"

#: includes/admin.php:34 templates/admin-status.php:23
msgid "DiluxOne Mail"
msgstr "DiluxOne Mail"

#. translators: 1: plugin name, 2: screen name
#: includes/admin.php:41
#, php-format
msgctxt "title of a dashboard screen"
msgid "%1$s | %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s | %2$s"

#: includes/admin.php:155
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes guardados."

#: includes/admin.php:156
msgid "Provider profile applied. Paste the credentials and save."
msgstr "Perfil del proveedor aplicado. Pegá las credenciales y guardá."

#: includes/admin.php:157
msgid "DiluxOne Mail is now handling this site's outgoing mail."
msgstr "DiluxOne Mail ahora gestiona el correo saliente de este sitio."

#: includes/admin.php:158
msgid "DNS cache cleared and the diagnosis run again."
msgstr "Caché de DNS vaciado y diagnóstico vuelto a correr."

#: includes/admin.php:159
msgid "The server answered and the credentials work. They are saved."
msgstr ""
"El servidor contestó y las credenciales funcionan. Quedaron guardadas."

#: includes/admin.php:160
msgid ""
"The server answered, but this PHP cannot encrypt the password (openssl with "
"AES-256-GCM is missing), and it is not stored in the clear. Set it through "
"the DILUXONE_MAIL_PASS constant in wp-config.php instead."
msgstr ""
"El servidor contestó, pero este PHP no puede cifrar la contraseña (falta "
"openssl con AES-256-GCM) y no se guarda en texto plano. Cargala con la "
"constante DILUXONE_MAIL_PASS en wp-config.php."

#: includes/admin.php:161
msgid ""
"That provider has no API here, only its SMTP server. Choose SMTP, or a "
"provider that does."
msgstr ""
"Ese proveedor no tiene API acá, sólo su servidor SMTP. Elegí SMTP, o un "
"proveedor que sí la tenga."

#: includes/admin.php:162
msgid "The provider recognised the key. It is saved."
msgstr "El proveedor reconoció la clave. Quedó guardada."

#: includes/admin.php:163
msgid ""
"The key is saved. The provider could not be asked whether it is valid, so "
"the test message is what will tell you."
msgstr ""
"La clave quedó guardada. No se le pudo preguntar al proveedor si es válida, "
"así que el mensaje de prueba es lo que te lo va a decir."

#: includes/admin.php:164
msgid "The provider does not recognise that key, so nothing was saved."
msgstr "El proveedor no reconoce esa clave, así que no se guardó nada."

#: includes/admin.php:165
msgid ""
"The server did not accept the connection, so nothing was saved. What went "
"wrong is below."
msgstr ""
"El servidor no aceptó la conexión, así que no se guardó nada. Abajo está qué"
" falló."

#: includes/admin.php:166
msgid "Test message sent."
msgstr "Mensaje de prueba enviado."

#: includes/admin.php:167
msgid ""
"This site's settings are fixed by the network and cannot be changed here."
msgstr "Los ajustes de este sitio los fija la red y no se pueden cambiar acá."

#. translators: %s: name of the constant
#: includes/admin.php:186
#, php-format
msgid "defined by the environment — PHP constant %s"
msgstr "definido por el entorno — constante de PHP %s"

#. translators: %s: name of the variable
#: includes/admin.php:189
#, php-format
msgid "defined by the environment — variable %s"
msgstr "definido por el entorno — variable %s"

#: includes/admin.php:191
msgid "stored, but it can no longer be decrypted — type it again"
msgstr "guardada, pero ya no se puede descifrar — escribila de nuevo"

#: includes/admin.php:193
msgid "set by the network"
msgstr "fijado por la red"

#: includes/admin.php:195
msgid "set on this site"
msgstr "fijado en este sitio"

#: includes/admin.php:197
msgid "default value"
msgstr "valor por defecto"

#: includes/admin.php:242
msgid ""
"This site fixes this from code: whatever is chosen here, it stays as it is."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio lo fija desde el código: lo que se elija acá, queda como está."

#: includes/api-providers.php:43
msgid "API token"
msgstr "Token de API"

#: includes/api-providers.php:44
msgid ""
"The token of the sending domain, from Sending Domains → your domain → "
"Integration. Not a token from the general API Tokens page, and not an Email "
"Testing one."
msgstr ""
"El token del dominio de envío, en Sending Domains → tu dominio → "
"Integration. No uno de la página general de API Tokens, ni uno de Email "
"Testing."

#: includes/api-providers.php:248
msgid "There is no key to check."
msgstr "No hay clave que verificar."

#: includes/api-providers.php:282
msgid "The provider does not recognise this key."
msgstr "El proveedor no reconoce esta clave."

#: includes/api-transport.php:123
msgid "There is no valid From address to send with."
msgstr "No hay una dirección de remitente válida con la que enviar."

#. translators: 1: HTTP status code, 2: what the provider answered
#: includes/api-transport.php:156
#, php-format
msgid "The provider refused the message (HTTP %1$d): %2$s"
msgstr "El proveedor rechazó el mensaje (HTTP %1$d): %2$s"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:157
msgid "There is no SPF record"
msgstr "No hay registro SPF"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:157
msgid ""
"Receivers have no way to know which servers may send mail for this domain, "
"and most of them treat that as a bad sign. Publish a TXT record starting "
"with v=spf1 that lists your provider and ends with -all."
msgstr ""
"Los receptores no tienen forma de saber qué servidores pueden mandar correo "
"por este dominio, y la mayoría lo toma como mala señal. Publicá un registro "
"TXT que empiece con v=spf1, liste a tu proveedor y termine en -all."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:160
msgid "The SPF record is invalid"
msgstr "El registro SPF es inválido"

#. translators: %d: number of lookups
#: includes/diagnostics.php:168
#, php-format
msgid "SPF uses %d DNS lookups; the limit is 10"
msgstr "El SPF gasta %d lookups de DNS; el límite es 10"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:169
msgid ""
"Going over the limit does not degrade SPF gracefully: receivers return a "
"permanent error and the whole record stops counting, as if it did not exist."
" Remove providers you no longer use, or replace include: entries with ip4: "
"entries where the provider documents stable addresses."
msgstr ""
"Pasarse del límite no degrada el SPF de a poco: los receptores devuelven un "
"error permanente y el registro entero deja de valer, como si no existiera. "
"Sacá los proveedores que ya no usás, o reemplazá los include: por ip4: donde"
" el proveedor documente direcciones estables."

#. translators: %d: number of lookups
#: includes/diagnostics.php:176 includes/diagnostics.php:184
#, php-format
msgid "SPF uses %d of the 10 allowed DNS lookups"
msgstr "El SPF gasta %d de los 10 lookups de DNS permitidos"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:177
msgid ""
"One more provider and it will break. Look at the tree below for includes you"
" can remove."
msgstr ""
"Un proveedor más y se rompe. Mirá en el árbol de abajo qué includes podés "
"sacar."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:185
msgid "Within the limit."
msgstr "Dentro del límite."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:190
msgid "SPF ends with +all"
msgstr "El SPF termina en +all"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:190
msgid ""
"That authorises every server on the internet to send as this domain. It is "
"the same as having no SPF, and worse in the eyes of most receivers. Change "
"it to -all."
msgstr ""
"Eso autoriza a cualquier servidor de internet a mandar como este dominio. Es"
" lo mismo que no tener SPF, y peor a los ojos de la mayoría de los "
"receptores. Cambialo a -all."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:192
msgid "SPF does not end with -all or ~all"
msgstr "El SPF no termina en -all ni en ~all"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:192
msgid ""
"Without a failing qualifier at the end, mail from unlisted servers is "
"neither accepted nor rejected — receivers treat the record as saying "
"nothing. Use -all once you are sure every legitimate sender is listed, or "
"~all while you check."
msgstr ""
"Sin un calificador de fallo al final, el correo de servidores no listados no"
" se acepta ni se rechaza: los receptores lo tratan como si el registro no "
"dijera nada. Usá -all cuando estés seguro de que todos los remitentes "
"legítimos están listados, o ~all mientras lo verificás."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/diagnostics.php:209
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not authorised in the SPF record"
msgstr "%s no está autorizado en el registro SPF"

#. translators: 1: provider name, 2: include to add
#: includes/diagnostics.php:212
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site sends through %1$s, but the SPF record does not include it, so "
"receivers will see the mail as coming from an unauthorised server. Add "
"include:%2$s to the record."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio manda por %1$s, pero el registro SPF no lo incluye, así que los "
"receptores van a ver el correo como venido de un servidor no autorizado. "
"Agregá include:%2$s al registro."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/diagnostics.php:226
#, php-format
msgid "SPF authorises %s, which is not the configured transport"
msgstr "El SPF autoriza a %s, que no es el transporte configurado"

#. translators: %s: include
#: includes/diagnostics.php:229
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If nothing else on this domain sends through it any more, remove include:%s "
"— it spends one of the 10 lookups and lets that provider send as you. If "
"another system still uses it, leave it."
msgstr ""
"Si ya nada de este dominio manda por ahí, sacá include:%s: gasta uno de los "
"10 lookups y deja que ese proveedor mande como vos. Si otro sistema todavía "
"lo usa, dejalo."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:244
msgid "No DKIM selector was found"
msgstr "No se encontró ningún selector DKIM"

#. translators: %d: number of selectors probed
#: includes/diagnostics.php:247
#, php-format
msgid ""
"None of the %d selectors probed exists on this domain. That does not prove "
"there is no DKIM — selectors cannot be listed over DNS, only guessed — but "
"if your provider gave you DKIM records to publish and they are not here, "
"mail is going out unsigned. Add your provider's selector in the settings and"
" revalidate."
msgstr ""
"Ninguno de los %d selectores probados existe en este dominio. Eso no prueba "
"que no haya DKIM —los selectores no se pueden listar por DNS, sólo "
"adivinar—, pero si tu proveedor te dio registros DKIM para publicar y no "
"están acá, el correo está saliendo sin firma. Agregá el selector de tu "
"proveedor en los ajustes y revalidá."

#. translators: %s: selector
#: includes/diagnostics.php:258
#, php-format
msgid "Selector %s is revoked"
msgstr "El selector %s está revocado"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:259
msgid ""
"It exists but carries an empty key, which is the standard way of saying "
"\"this key no longer signs anything\". If your provider uses it, mail is "
"going out with a signature nobody can verify."
msgstr ""
"Existe pero tiene la clave vacía, que es la forma que da el estándar de "
"decir «esta clave ya no firma nada». Si tu proveedor lo usa, el correo está "
"saliendo con una firma que nadie puede verificar."

#. translators: %s: selector
#: includes/diagnostics.php:266
#, php-format
msgid "Selector %s uses a 1024-bit key"
msgstr "El selector %s usa una clave de 1024 bits"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:267
msgid ""
"It works, but 1024 bits is considered weak and some receivers score it down."
" Most providers can rotate to 2048 from their dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Funciona, pero 1024 bits se considera débil y algunos receptores lo "
"penalizan. La mayoría de los proveedores puede rotar a 2048 desde su panel."

#. translators: 1: selector, 2: key size
#: includes/diagnostics.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "Selector %1$s is published (%2$s)"
msgstr "El selector %1$s está publicado (%2$s)"

#. translators: 1: selector, 2: key size
#: includes/diagnostics.php:274
msgid "key size unknown"
msgstr "tamaño de clave desconocido"

#. translators: %s: CNAME target
#: includes/diagnostics.php:277
#, php-format
msgid "Delegated by CNAME to %s, so the provider rotates the key for you."
msgstr "Delegado por CNAME a %s, así que el proveedor rota la clave por vos."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:278
msgid "Published directly on the domain."
msgstr "Publicado directamente en el dominio."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/diagnostics.php:298
#, php-format
msgid "No DKIM record for %s"
msgstr "No hay registro DKIM para %s"

#. translators: 1: provider name, 2: selectors
#: includes/diagnostics.php:301
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s signs mail with the selector(s) %2$s, and none of them is published on "
"this domain. Mail goes out signed by the provider's own domain instead of "
"yours, which does not count for DMARC alignment. Copy the DKIM records from "
"the provider's dashboard into your DNS."
msgstr ""
"%1$s firma el correo con el selector %2$s, y no está publicado en este "
"dominio. El correo sale firmado por el dominio del proveedor en vez del "
"tuyo, y eso no cuenta para la alineación de DMARC. Copiá los registros DKIM "
"del panel del proveedor a tu DNS."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:310
msgid "There is no DMARC record"
msgstr "No hay registro DMARC"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:310
msgid ""
"Without DMARC, receivers decide on their own what to do when SPF and DKIM do"
" not add up, and you get no reports about who is sending as your domain. "
"Start with v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:you@yourdomain to receive reports "
"without affecting delivery, then tighten it."
msgstr ""
"Sin DMARC, los receptores deciden por su cuenta qué hacer cuando SPF y DKIM "
"no cierran, y vos no recibís ningún reporte de quién está mandando como tu "
"dominio. Empezá con v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:vos@tudominio para recibir "
"reportes sin afectar la entrega, y después ajustalo."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:313
msgid "The DMARC record is invalid"
msgstr "El registro DMARC es inválido"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:319
msgid "DMARC policy is p=none: monitoring only"
msgstr "La política DMARC es p=none: sólo monitoreo"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:319
msgid ""
"Receivers report but do nothing. It is the right first step; once the "
"reports show only legitimate senders, move to p=quarantine."
msgstr ""
"Los receptores reportan pero no hacen nada. Es el primer paso correcto; "
"cuando los reportes muestren sólo remitentes legítimos, pasá a p=quarantine."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:321
msgid "rejected"
msgstr "rechazado"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:321
msgid "sent to spam"
msgstr "mandado a spam"

#. translators: %s: policy
#: includes/diagnostics.php:328
#, php-format
msgid "DMARC policy is p=%s: alignment is required"
msgstr "La política DMARC es p=%s: hace falta alineación"

#. translators: %s: what happens to the mail
#: includes/diagnostics.php:331
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Mail that fails both SPF and DKIM alignment will be %s. With no transport "
"configured here, this plugin cannot tell whether your sender aligns."
msgstr ""
"El correo que no alinee ni por SPF ni por DKIM va a ser %s. Sin un "
"transporte configurado acá, este plugin no puede saber si tu remitente "
"alinea."

#. translators: %s: policy
#: includes/diagnostics.php:340
#, php-format
msgid "DMARC policy is p=%s and mail aligns through DKIM"
msgstr "La política DMARC es p=%s y el correo alinea por DKIM"

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/diagnostics.php:343
#, php-format
msgid ""
"SPF alignment usually fails with a third-party provider — the bounce address"
" is theirs, not yours — but %s signs with your domain's DKIM key, and one "
"aligned mechanism is enough."
msgstr ""
"La alineación por SPF suele fallar con un proveedor externo —la dirección de"
" rebote es de ellos, no tuya—, pero %s firma con la clave DKIM de tu "
"dominio, y con un mecanismo alineado alcanza."

#. translators: %s: policy
#: includes/diagnostics.php:352
#, php-format
msgid "DMARC policy is p=%s but nothing aligns"
msgstr "La política DMARC es p=%s pero nada alinea"

#. translators: 1: provider name, 2: what happens to the mail
#: includes/diagnostics.php:355
#, php-format
msgid ""
"With %1$s as the transport, SPF is not aligned (the bounce address belongs "
"to the provider) and no DKIM key of yours is published for it. Every message"
" will be %2$s. Publish the provider's DKIM records — that is the fix — or "
"drop the policy to p=none until you do."
msgstr ""
"Con %1$s como transporte, el SPF no está alineado (la dirección de rebote es"
" del proveedor) y no hay ninguna clave DKIM tuya publicada para él. Cada "
"mensaje va a ser %2$s. Publicá los registros DKIM del proveedor —ése es el "
"arreglo— o bajá la política a p=none hasta que lo hagas."

#. translators: %d: percentage
#: includes/diagnostics.php:368
#, php-format
msgid "The policy applies to %d%% of mail"
msgstr "La política se aplica al %d%% del correo"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:369
msgid ""
"pct= below 100 means receivers apply the policy to a sample and let the rest"
" through. Fine while ramping up; set it to 100 when you are done."
msgstr ""
"pct= por debajo de 100 significa que los receptores aplican la política a "
"una muestra y dejan pasar el resto. Está bien mientras se despliega; ponelo "
"en 100 cuando termines."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:374
msgid "DMARC has no report address (rua)"
msgstr "El DMARC no tiene dirección de reportes (rua)"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:374
msgid ""
"You will never learn who is sending as your domain or what fails. Add "
"rua=mailto:an-address-you-read."
msgstr ""
"Nunca vas a enterarte de quién manda como tu dominio ni de qué falla. Agregá"
" rua=mailto:una-dirección-que-leas."

#. translators: %s: address
#: includes/diagnostics.php:383
#, php-format
msgid "Reports to %s are being discarded"
msgstr "Los reportes a %s se están descartando"

#. translators: 1: report domain, 2: name of the missing record
#: includes/diagnostics.php:386
#, php-format
msgid ""
"That address is on another domain (%1$s), and the standard requires that "
"domain to say it accepts reports for yours. It does not: there is no TXT "
"record at %2$s with v=DMARC1. Until it is published, receivers throw the "
"reports away."
msgstr ""
"Esa dirección es de otro dominio (%1$s), y el estándar exige que ese dominio"
" diga que acepta reportes por el tuyo. No lo dice: no hay un registro TXT en"
" %2$s con v=DMARC1. Hasta que se publique, los receptores tiran los "
"reportes."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:397
msgid "The domain has no MX record"
msgstr "El dominio no tiene registro MX"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:397
msgid ""
"Sending still works, but nothing can be received at this domain: replies and"
" bounces to your From address go nowhere, and some receivers distrust "
"senders that cannot receive."
msgstr ""
"Mandar sigue funcionando, pero en este dominio no se puede recibir nada: las"
