"Stored encrypted with a key derived from this site's WordPress salts, and "
"never shown again."
msgstr ""
"Se guarda cifrada con una clave derivada de las salts de WordPress de este "
"sitio, y no se vuelve a mostrar."

#: templates/settings-api.php:62 templates/settings-profile.php:81
